igence across its lifecycle, from the AI agents and models to the foundational infrastructure that supports the entire AI ecosystem and with Snowflake to bring AI-native security and enterprise data at scale. Additionally, it has a partnership with Fortanix Inc. to combine its Falcon platform with Fortanix Confidential AI to provide an integrated solution for end-to-end AI security. The company was incorporated in 2011 and is headquartered in Austin, Texas.","fullTimeEmployees":11706,"city":"Austin","country":"United States","website":"https://www.crowdstrike.com","industry":"Software - Infrastructure","sector":"Technology"},"news":[],"info_date":"2026-10-31"}